        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nWhat ultimately gives existence value is the quality of conscious experience\u2014the presence of joy, love, fulfillment, and deep engagement, coupled with the reduction of suffering. Because the experiences inside are subjectively indistinguishable from physical reality, entering the machine maximizes net well-being, happiness, and flourishing over the course of a lifetime.",
